Error [jet.NondeterminismInPureEval]: `math.random` is non-deterministic and cannot appear in a pure evaluation.
  --> tests/ui/effect_math_random_in_pure_fn.jet:3:36
    |
  3 | fn draw() -[]> Float Never! { math.random() }
    |                                    ^^^^^^
 Why: Pure evaluation must produce the same result on every machine.
 Fix: Remove this call, or remove the enclosing function's explicit empty effect bound.
